### Variables
@baseUrl = https://EWB-api-weu-001.azure-api.net/func-parquetingest-weu-001
@apiKey = {{$dotenv AZURE_APIM_KEY}}
@sourceId = werkportal__api__invoice
@sourceIdEncoded = werkportal__api__invoice
@sourceName = Werkportal Invoice
@contentType = application/json
@trace = true

### ============================================================================
### HEALTH & STATUS
### ============================================================================

###
### Health Check (Anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/health HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

### ============================================================================
### SOURCES MANAGEMENT
### ============================================================================

###
### List All Sources
GET {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/sources HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

###
### Get Source by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/sources/{{sourceIdEncoded}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

###
### Update Source Configuration (Buffer, Schedule, Output)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/sources/{{sourceIdEncoded}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

{
  "buffer": {
    "min_rows": 30,
    "max_rows": 60,
    "max_age_minutes": 60
  }
}

###
### Update Schedule Only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/sources/{{sourceIdEncoded}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

{
  "schedule": {
    "enabled": true,
    "cron": "0 */15 * * * *"
  }
}

###
### Reload Configuration
POST {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/reload-config HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

### ============================================================================
### BUFFER & METADATA
### ============================================================================

###
### Get Buffer Status for Source
GET {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/buffer/{{sourceIdEncoded}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

###
### Get Ingestion Metadata for Source
GET {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/metadata/{{sourceIdEncoded}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

###
### Get Flush Status / Prediction (NEW)
# Shows when the next flush will happen based on rows and age
GET {{baseUrl}}/mgmt/flush-status/{{sourceIdEncoded}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

### ============================================================================
### INGEST ORCHESTRATION
### ============================================================================

###
### Trigger Ingest (Active Source)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/{{sourceId}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

###
### Trigger Ingest with Force Flush
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/{{sourceId}}?force_flush=true HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

###
### Trigger Ingest (Passive Source with Payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/{{sourceId}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "123",
      "name": "Test Record"
    }
  ]
}

###
### Get Ingest Status (requires instance_id)
# @instanceId = your-instance-id-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/ingest/{{sourceId}}?instance_id={{instanceId}} HTTP/1.1
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{apiKey}}
Ocp-Apim-Trace: {{trace}}

###
